.TH SANDBOXDIFF 1
.SH NAME
sandboxdiff \\- compare two JSON workload snapshots
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B sandboxdiff
sandboxdiff --left FILE --right FILE [--format json]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Compares two structured workload snapshots and emits JSON differences.
.SH OPTIONS
Use \fBsandboxdiff --help\fR for the complete, version-specific flag list.
.SH EXIT STATUS
Uses the shared CLI status convention: 0 success, 1 a completed negative finding or policy failure, 2 invalid usage, 3 a partial result, and 4 a runtime failure. Not every status applies to every command.
